  "description": "Given an integer array nums sorted in non-decreasing order, return an array of the squares of each number, sorted in non-decreasing order.",
  "pseudocode": "1: let res = new Array(nums.length)\n2: let left = 0, right = nums.length - 1\n3: for (let k = nums.length - 1; k >= 0; k--) {\n4:   if (Math.abs(nums[left]) > Math.abs(nums[right])) {\n5:     res[k] = nums[left] * nums[left]; left++\n6:   } else {\n7:     res[k] = nums[right] * nums[right]; right--\n8:   }\n9: }",
